# C99 features this compiler does not support yet, one per line:
# <probe> <reason>.  They are counted separately, and a knownfail that
# starts PASSING is a failure -- so the list cannot rot, and closing a gap
# means deleting a line.
#
# Empty since 2026-09-24.  Twelve entries were here on 2026-09-23 when the
# suite was written; the last four to go were _Pragma, hexadecimal floating
# constants, universal character names in identifiers, and the GNU
# `, ## __VA_ARGS__` form (not C99, but in every logging macro).
